Package: infiltrator-os-plymouth-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects <noreply@infiltrator-projects.invalid>
Depends: plymouth, apt, wget, ca-certificates, bash, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64
Description: Infiltrator OS branding and native application integration
 Installs the canonical Infiltrator OS Plymouth splash for Debian and
 Linux Mint derived systems, selects it as the active theme, rebuilds
 initramfs, and replaces distribution System Monitor and Calculator packages
 with Infiltrator builds compiled aggressively for the local CPU.
 Version 1.0.4 adds native two-pass Calculator provisioning and serialises
 heavy native application builds so they do not compete for package locks or CPU.
